## 6. 测试内容（7 条，均为真实断言）

| 测试 | 断言内容 |
| --- | --- |
| `list_words tokenizes frozen oracle texts` | `short_simple_sentence` 6 词全表；`hyphenated_words` 17 词全表；`numbers_and_symbols` 28 词全表；`punctuation_only` / `empty_string` / `whitespace_only` → `[]` |
| `list_words fuses or splits hyphens and keeps digit runs` | `well-known` → `["wellknown"]`；`split_hyphens=true` → `["well","known"]`；`$1,299.99` → `["129999"]`；`3.14` → `["314"]`；`12.5%` → `["125"]`；`8,000` → `["8000"]` |
| `list_words keeps contraction apostrophes and deletes the others` | `aren't`/`he'll`/`we've`/`I'd`/`it's` 保留撇号；`'quoted'` → `["quoted"]`；`rock'n'roll` → `["rocknroll"]`；`rm_apostrophe=true`：`aren't` → `["arent"]` |
| `split_contractions splits only apostrophes before a contraction ending` | `aren't` → `["aren","t"]`；`he'll` → `["he","ll"]`；`we've` → `["we","ve"]`；`can't won't shouldn't` → 6 token；`Don'T` → `["DonT"]`（大小写敏感）；`rm_apostrophe=true` 同时 → `["arent"]`；`rm_punctuation=false` 同时 → `["aren","t"]` |
| `list_words applies toggles in the upstream order` | `Hello WORLD` + `lowercase` → `["hello","world"]`；` .? ` + `rm_punctuation=false` → `[".?"]`；`-` + `split_hyphens` + `rm_punctuation=false` → `[]`；`well-known` + `split_hyphens` + `rm_punctuation=false` → `["well","known"]`；`Aren't` + `lowercase` + `split_contractions` → `["aren","t"]`；`DON'T` 同开关 → `["dont"]`（顺序证据） |
| `list_words keeps BMP letters and deletes astral code points` | `ó` → `["ó"]`；`fórmulas` → `["fórmulas"]`；`a🤣b` → `["ab"]`；`🤣` → `[]` |
| `list_words splits on Python whitespace and drops empty tokens` | `a\u00A0b\u3000c` → 3 token；`a\u001Cb` → 2 token；`""` / `"   \n\t "` / `"\u00A0\u3000"` → `[]` |

无快照测试（值稳定，按 AGENTS.md 用 `assert_eq`）。

